Register again without starting over, issue #77, docs/sip.md.

ua_register makes a new registration, and dropping the old one sends an
unregister first: the two can cross at the server and leave the account
unregistered. ua_refresh_register sends a REGISTER at once on each existing
registration (libre's sipreg_refresh, sip/patches/re-0002), for
t48keepalive when the network comes back or the public address changes.

